      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلْتَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>channel</i> [or <i>oblong depression</i>] <i>between
the two mustaches, against the partition between
the two nostrils:</i> also called the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُنْعُبَة</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُوتَة</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُومَة</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَزْمَة</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهْدَة</span>. (TA.)

